WEBVTT

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:31.854
to calm our insecurity

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:35.274
about what we intuitively know.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:37.568
So I’m advocating

00:11:38.986 --> 00:11:42.614
that we decrease the dosage of our data.

00:11:44.116 --> 00:11:47.953
And that we increase
the implementation of our intuition.

00:11:48.787 --> 00:11:49.955
You’ll feel great,

00:11:50.748 --> 00:11:51.874
you really will ...

00:11:52.791 --> 00:11:55.169
when you're able to prove to yourself

00:11:56.920 --> 00:12:01.341
that the power of your intuition
is actually accurate.